#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:155
msgid "Install Widevine"
msgstr "Widevine installeren"

#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:162
msgid ""
"Widevine is a plugin that lets you play DRM-protected content, such as music "
"and movies from streaming services."
msgstr ""
"Widevine is een uitbreiding voor het bekijken van media, zoals muziek en "
"films op streamingdiensten, die van DRM-beveiliging voorzien is."

#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:169
msgid ""
"Widevine is not licensed for use with Morph Browser. The plugin will be "
"extracted from a proprietary package. Proceed only if you accept this risk."
msgstr ""
"Let op: Widevine is niet officieel goedgekeurd voor gebruik in deze browser. "
"De uitbreiding zal worden ingeladen vanuit een gesloten pakket. Als je "
"doorgaat, accepteer je dit risico."

#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:175
msgid "Warning!"
msgstr ""

#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:183
msgid ""
"Installing Widevine requires downloading about 150 MB of data. A stable "
"Internet connection is required and the download may take some time."
msgstr ""
"De downloadgrootte van Widevine is ongeveer 150 MB. Een stabiele "
"internetverbinding is vereist; het downloaden kan enige tijd duren."

#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:192
#, qt-format
msgid "The file containing the Widevine plugin will be downloaded from %1."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:219
msgid "License agreement"
msgstr "Licentie-overeenkomst"

#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:226
msgid ""
"The download is complete. Please read the following license agreement "
"carefully before installing Widevine."
msgstr ""
"Het downloaden is voltooid. Lees de licentie-overeenkomst zorgvuldig door "
"voordat je de installatie van Widevine voortzet."

#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:233
msgid "Widevine license"
msgstr "Widevine-licentie"

#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:261
msgid "Downloading"
msgstr "Bezig met downloaden…"

#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:285
