msgstr "De installatie is voltooid."

#: src/app/webbrowser/qml-qt6/widevine/WidevineInstallerWizard.qml:320
msgid "Morph has to be restarted for the changes to take effect."
msgstr "Herstart de browser om de uitbreiding in gebruik te nemen."

